			"notes": "## New Features\n* Added mod configuration:\n  * Switch language between English and Russian\n  * Reset language, which resets mod language to the minecraft selected language\n* Added shard recipes calculator\n  * Support for instant buy bazaar\n  * Support for instant sell bazaar\n  * Includes support for Tiamat, Crocodile, and Sea Serpent levels\n* Added support for displaying recipe tree directly during fusing\n\n## New commands\n* `/gh` - opens a mod configuration screen\n* `/ghrecipe` - opens a shard recipes screen\n* `/ghrecipe <shard_name>` - opens a shard recipes screen with the text written in the search field\n\n## New screens\n* Added mod configuration screen\n* Added shard recipes screen\n  * DIsplays the total number of shards required to craft\n  * Displays the total cost of required shards\n  * Displays the total coins saved in the craft\n  * Displays the number of times the Pure Reptile has been triggered\n  * Displays the number of total crafts\n  * Displays an interactive shard recipe tree"
		}
